        "",
        "",
        "モンスターを追跡するテルル＆マズルを追いかける一行。\nしかし彼女たちの背を視界に捉えるだけで、精一杯だった。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "4f64ff46b0e9546174ca40ba255b5e027e2f5a6cb2e87a0532d1a08780f93b62",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "もう追いかけるのやめようよぉ。\nめんどくさくなっちゃった。\nいいじゃん。ご主人くんが一生裸足でも～。",
      "jp_sha256": "2ba1bcb450bcb07df1c8e2379215fc3a8baf47697a1f047b98b5fd5e5a48e3df",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "이제 쫓아가는 거 그만두자아.\n귀찮아졌어.\n괜찮잖아. 주인공 군이 평생 맨발이어도~.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 19,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b017-20261110-09783baa3a87",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "be7f270fa6573bac5da8944fd928640a73383b213fd5314a15b9e663588c5625:000000_-8381776948820268359:g0:r18",
      "row_index_0based": 18,
      "serialized_row_index": 18,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ニグリュ",
        "Emt2_Ang",
        "layer_右",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "もう追いかけるのやめようよぉ。\nめんどくさくなっちゃった。\nいいじゃん。ご主人くんが一生裸足でも～。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ニグリュ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "2ede7ea69dea20a1fabb9f08d56eb623a1e150e84bf98ea1a94734276bcec37f",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "よくないですよぉ～！　裸足は困りますぅ～！\nそれにはやく、テルルさんとマズルさんの暴走を止めないとっ！",
      "jp_sha256": "0da55e527db2c0186ed393d7c7d6fb05ce4eb8780929b1c7ea2195f03d78db5d",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "안 괜찮아요~! 맨발은 곤란해요~!\n그리고 빨리 테룰 씨와 머즐 씨의 폭주를 막아야 해요!",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b017-20261110-09783baa3a87",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "be7f270fa6573bac5da8944fd928640a73383b213fd5314a15b9e663588c5625:000000_-8381776948820268359:g0:r19",
      "row_index_0based": 19,
      "serialized_row_index": 19,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "よくないですよぉ～！　裸足は困りますぅ～！\nそれにはやく、テルルさんとマズルさんの暴走を止めないとっ！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "2aac350d0c127b46a1c7c4b944b429f3cd2390e807e4ed077a901a949a7c75ac",
